# requirements.in
# ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
# Human-maintained source of truth for Megaploit's Python dependencies.
# Intentionally loose — only minimum bounds are specified here.
#
# DO NOT install this file directly.  Use either:
#   pip install -r requirements.txt                          # flexible (end-users)
#   pip install -r requirements.txt -c constraints.txt      # pinned  (CI / reproducible installs)
#
# To regenerate constraints.txt after updating bounds here:
#   pip install pip-tools
#   pip-compile requirements.in --output-file constraints.txt
#
# System requirements:
#   git must be on PATH (for toolbox clone/update and self-update checks)
#   For exe/elf payload compilation: pip install pyinstaller
#   For UPX packing: install upx from https://upx.github.io/

# ── Core (operator console) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
